# One target/ for the whole lane — see Cargo.toml.
#
# Unanchored on purpose. `/target` would cover only the workspace root's, and a
# stray per-relic target/ — a leftover from before the workspace, or a member
# built with an overridden target-dir — would go unignored and be staged. There
# is no tracked path named target/ at any depth, so the broad rule costs nothing.
target/
